sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Service as service.RemotePlanner<br/>internal/service/remote_planner.go
    participant Adapter as todoapi.Client<br/>internal/infrastructure/client/todoapi/todoapi.go
    participant Stub as todo.ItemsServiceClient<br/>gen/client/todo/todo_grpc.pb.go
    participant Interceptor as grpcclient interceptor and attempt<br/>internal/infrastructure/client/core/grpcclient/client.go
    participant API as Todo API, or with TODO_API_HOST=mock its emulator<br/>internal/infrastructure/client/todoapi/mock/todoapi_mock.go

    Service->>+Adapter: PlanItems(ctx, titles)
    Adapter->>+Stub: PlanItems(ctx, request)
    Stub->>+Interceptor: the call of /todo.v1.ItemsService/PlanItems
    Note over Interceptor: the method is in the adapter's list, the client middleware run around each attempt
    Note over Interceptor: record "grpc client call sent"
    Interceptor->>+API: PlanItems, x-request-id, within TODO_API_TIMEOUT
    API-->>-Interceptor: response, or a status
    Note over Interceptor: record "grpc client call answered"
    Interceptor-->>-Stub: response, or outcome.ErrUnavailable, or outcome.StatusError
    Stub-->>-Adapter: the generated response, or the outcome
    Adapter-->>-Service: []todoapi.Item, or the outcome
    Note over Service: ErrUnavailable: entity.ErrUnavailable. Code INVALID_ARGUMENT: entity.ErrInvalid. Anything else: no kind
